WEBVTT

00:02:28.109 --> 00:02:31.506
but you know what it's like to feel
disconnected from your colleagues,

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:33.706
especially during the
coronavirus pandemic.

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:36.336
As billions of people have
had to embrace isolation,

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:39.376
there's been a shared experience
of loneliness at work.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.869
Even before this, though,

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:45.826
many of us were feeling lonely more often
and more intensely than in the past.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:49.766
Luckily, doing something about it
takes less than you might think.

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:52.373
(WorkLife theme music)

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:59.276
AG: I'm Adam Grant, and this is WorkLife,
my podcast with TED.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.176
I'm an organizational psychologist.